{"html":"<article class=\"ec-renew container-site\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页 →</a></nav><header><p class=\"ec-renew-kicker\">采购与项目规划</p><h1>节庆活动杯具与图稿规划</h1><p class=\"ec-renew-lead\">将节庆图稿与产品用途、服务方式和发放需求匹配。</p><a href=\"/zh/contact/\">准备项目询盘 →</a></header><figure class=\"ec-renew-photo\"><img src=\"/img/renewal/application-illustration-20261026.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"活动饮品服务视觉示意\"><figcaption>生成活动概念示意，非客户活动或完成订单实拍。</figcaption></figure><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>按实际服务方式选型</h2><p>核对设计数量、颜色参考、杯标和包装。节庆视觉只是设计概念，不是完成订单或性能证明。</p></section><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>把选型条件写进需求</h2><div class=\"ec-renew-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>采购项</th><th>确认内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>饮品与场地</td><td>饮品、单次份量、容器规定、使用区域及清理安排。</td></tr><tr><td>型号与组件</td><td>杯型、材料、杯盖或吸管、服务工具及数量。</td></tr><tr><td>图稿与批准</td><td>图稿版本、颜色参考、实际样品和核对项目。</td></tr><tr><td>包装与交付</td><td>个人发放或服务点配置、包装、交货地及到货日期。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"ec-renew-section\"><h2>继续比较产品与证据</h2><a href=\"/zh/products/\">查看相关器型与型号 →</a><a href=\"/zh/certificates/\">咨询项目文件 →</a></section><section class=\"ec-scenario-index container-site\" id=\"scenario-models\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">按型号继续比较</p><h2>此场景的参考型号</h2><p>共 24 款建议参考型号。展开产品类型查看；进入详情页核对选用理由与项目要求。</p><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">这些是采购规划建议，不代表所有型号适用于相同饮品、温度或操作条件。</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-model-groups\"><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>开瓶器 <span>(1)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/christmas-silicone-bottle-cap-opener/\"><strong>KPQ-023</strong><span>硅胶开瓶器（圣诞礼盒/雪人/姜饼人等节日造型）</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>变色杯 <span>(7)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/12-oz-color-changing-plastic-stadium-bsb001/\"><strong>BSB-001</strong><span>体育场杯(Stadium Cup) 12 oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/16-oz-color-changing-plastic-stadium-bsb002/\"><strong>BSB-002</strong><span>户外定制遇冷变色塑胶杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/22-oz-color-changing-plastic-stadium-bsb003/\"><strong>BSB-003</strong><span>体育场杯(Stadium Cup) 22 oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/12-oz-color-changing-stadium-cup/\"><strong>BSB-004</strong><span>体育场杯(Stadium Cup) 12 oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/22-oz-color-changing-stadium-cup/\"><strong>BSB-006</strong><span>体育场杯(Stadium Cup) 22 oz</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/14-oz-color-changing-beer-stein-bsb011/\"><strong>BSB-011</strong><span>户外定制遇冷变色扎啤杯</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/17-oz-color-changing-splatter-cup/\"><strong>BSB-013</strong><span>溅色杯(Splatter Cup) 17 oz</span></a></li></ul></details><details class=\"ec-scenario-model-group\"><summary>酒杯识别饰件 <span>(15)</span></summary><ul class=\"ec-scenario-model-list\"><li><a href=\"/zh/products/koala-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\"><strong>JBPJ-074</strong><span>定制考拉造型硅胶酒杯标记（货号 BT-15）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/black-white-cat-shaped-silicone-wine/\"><strong>JBPJ-075</strong><span>定制黑白猫造型硅胶酒杯标记（货号 BT-06）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/butterfly-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\"><strong>JBPJ-076</strong><span>定制蝴蝶造型硅胶酒杯标记·多色（货号 BT-03）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-alphabet-letter-shaped-wine-glass/\"><strong>JBPJ-077</strong><span>定制字母造型硅胶酒杯标记套装（货号 BT-01）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/pineapple-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\"><strong>JBPJ-078</strong><span>定制菠萝造型硅胶酒杯标记套装（货号 BT-10）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/flamingo-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\"><strong>JBPJ-079</strong><span>定制火烈鸟造型硅胶酒杯标记套装（货号 BT-11）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-fish-turtle-shaped-wine-glass/\"><strong>JBPJ-080</strong><span>定制海洋动物（鱼·龟）造型硅胶酒杯标记套装（货号 BT-14）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/black-bow-shaped-champagne-glass-charms/\"><strong>JBPJ-081</strong><span>定制黑色蝴蝶结造型香槟杯标记（货号 BT-02）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/flower-and-ring-shap-champagne-glass/\"><strong>JBPJ-082</strong><span>定制花朵+圆环造型香槟杯标记（货号 BT-04）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-multi-color-ring-wine-glass/\"><strong>JBPJ-083</strong><span>定制多色圆环硅胶酒杯识别扣（货号 BT-16）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/spiral-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-markers/\"><strong>JBPJ-084</strong><span>定制螺旋造型硅胶酒杯识别扣套装（货号 BT-09）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-alpaca-cat-shaped-cup-markers/\"><strong>JBPJ-085</strong><span>定制羊驼/猫造型硅胶杯标记扣（货号 BT-05）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-colorful-snail-shaped-cup-markers/\"><strong>JBPJ-086</strong><span>定制彩色蜗牛造型硅胶杯标记扣（货号 BT-07）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/cartoon-mice-pair-shaped-silicone-wine/\"><strong>JBPJ-088</strong><span>定制卡通成对造型硅胶酒杯标记（货号 BT-12）</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/zh/products/silicone-snowflake-wine-glass-charms-for/\"><strong>JBPJ-089</strong><span>定制雪花造型硅胶酒杯标记·圣诞款（货号 BT-13）</span></a></li></ul></details></div></section><footer class=\"ec-renew-next\"><h2>把下一步说清楚</h2><p>提供型号、用途、预计数量、图稿、交货地与需要到货日期；未确定的项目可以先说明。</p><a href=\"/zh/contact/\">准备项目询盘 →</a><p>内容更新：2026-10-26</p></footer></article>"}